      "title": {
        "en": "Supportive and attentive medical personnel"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Reviewers consistently praise Dr. Pou, Dr. Romero, Dr. Secco, and technicians like Maya and Ayleen for their thorough medical knowledge and compassionate bedside manner. Clients appreciate that clinicians answer detailed questions without rushing and keep pet parents informed during treatments. Pet owners frequently note that the entire team treats animal patients like beloved family."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 19,
      "title": {
        "en": "Caring approach for all breeds"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet parents emphasize how gently the clinic handles animals of every size, from energetic French bulldogs and Yorkies to giant Great Danes and nervous cats. Reviewers mention that technicians use calm techniques to soothe anxious pets during examinations and blood draws. Clients feel reassured that their pets receive respectful and loving attention throughout visits."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 13,
      "title": {
        "en": "Effective diagnostic and surgical care"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Clients report dependable medical outcomes across wellness exams, dental cleanings, extractions, and acute health concerns. Reviewers highlight accurate diagnoses that quickly resolved persistent symptoms like drooling and neck discomfort. Many longtime clients state that the clinic has sustained their pets' health over years of regular care."
      }
    }
  ],
